<title>UK: CSFB leads $250 million asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>CSFB leads $250 million asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Tuesday it was lead manager of a $250 million three-year asset-backed deal launched in the name of Asset Backed Capital Ltd.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT	  $250 MLN  COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    15.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.1125  PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.925    SPREAD	++16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS UK/JP/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE AUGUST 1999</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
